      <p>Like Vultr, DigitalOcean uses flat per-hour pricing across all plans. Their entry-level droplet at &#36;4/mo (1GB RAM, 25GB SSD, 1TB transfer) has the same price whether you deploy it today or five years from now.</p>
      <p><strong>What DigitalOcean does well:</strong></p>
