      <p>DigitalOcean is best for startups, learning environments, and any project where predictable infrastructure costs matter more than the absolute lowest price. The trade-off is that &#36;4/mo entry is higher than RackNerd's &#36;1.49/mo annual rate — but you get the peace of mind of zero pricing games.</p>
