      <p>InterServer is the best choice for users who prioritize long-term cost certainty above all else. The trade-off is a higher entry price (&#36;6/mo vs RackNerd's &#36;1.49/mo annual equivalent) and only two US datacenters. But for users who have been burned by renewal surprises, the price lock guarantee is priceless.</p>

